Eruko Maths Signs is TeX Gyre Bonum Math 1.005 (Bogusław Jackowski, Piotr Strzelczyk and Piotr
Pianowski, GUST e-foundry), changed by Eruko: cut to the code points listed in VENDOR.json, its
names changed to "Eruko Maths Signs", saved as WOFF2 (scripts/maths-fonts.py). The font as its
authors released it: https://mirrors.ctan.org/fonts/tex-gyre-math/. It is distributed under the
GUST Font License, the text below, which names the LaTeX Project Public License 1.3c
(https://www.latex-project.org/lppl/lppl-1-3c.txt).

